{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lumina Rush \u2013 Speed, Style, and Competition!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Slide, blast, and swing</strong> your way through adrenaline-pumping levels in <strong>Lumina Rush</strong>, the ultimate momentum-based platformer! Master every movement, <strong>shave off seconds</strong>, and dominate the leaderboards. Got the reflexes? Prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feel the Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Speed4.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is designed to let you <strong>keep up the momentum</strong>\u2014find the fastest route, execute the perfect moves, and push your skills to the limit. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Customize2.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn medals, discover collectibles, and unlock <strong>stylish cosmetics</strong> to make your character stand out as you race to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create &amp; Compete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/LevelEditor.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own <strong>custom levels</strong> with the <strong>intuitive level editor</strong>, share them with the world, and challenge others to beat your best times on the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Versus3.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on your rivals in <strong>head-to-head versus mode</strong>\u2014who\u2019s got the fastest reflexes and the sharpest routes? There's only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Strap in, rev up, and experience the rush!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Orb Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/32c7663908ab778f078f39df273dec26fd001b47.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/a4b9d891e547b1238a57b623e0d74da1b483d757.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/792c582b1abf29d89708633a4faeb987a5892214.jpg"},{"name":"Get Ready","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/e166d6539f09a621800e108334ef43087ec3ecd4.jpg"},{"name":"Time Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/4b2035780357cdb76cd68ab016b5e9e4fb235a5f.jpg"},{"name":"Silver King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/94b0796064772e03c16a6ace4f0e5ae03e1d6c47.jpg"},{"name":"Let Him Cook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/3169ff62fb31ee174b6f485db10386939f4e9328.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Fool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/9c2046ca8481a4f7293129a50567af18667e55f9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/e626e37c135d0e0aece8bfbf93cebbe33ed16d72.jpg"},{"name":"Go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2872830/e82fdd7439538b7e39264cf64f9fb7cdc1ccdbc0.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872830?t=1741038512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2872830?t=1741038512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/3e22af40345506b275fabc45290b8793d6604aa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741038512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/3e22af40345506b275fabc45290b8793d6604aa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741038512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2928920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lumina Rush \u2013 Speed, Style, and Competition!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Slide, blast, and swing</strong> your way through adrenaline-pumping levels in <strong>Lumina Rush</strong>, the ultimate momentum-based platformer! Master every movement, <strong>shave off seconds</strong>, and dominate the leaderboards. Got the reflexes? Prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feel the Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Speed4.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is designed to let you <strong>keep up the momentum</strong>\u2014find the fastest route, execute the perfect moves, and push your skills to the limit. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Customize2.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn medals, discover collectibles, and unlock <strong>stylish cosmetics</strong> to make your character stand out as you race to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create &amp; Compete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/LevelEditor.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own <strong>custom levels</strong> with the <strong>intuitive level editor</strong>, share them with the world, and challenge others to beat your best times on the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Race Your Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/extras/Versus3.gif?t=1741038512\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on your rivals in <strong>head-to-head versus mode</strong>\u2014who\u2019s got the fastest reflexes and the sharpest routes? There's only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Strap in, rev up, and experience the rush!</strong> \ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Battered Lute Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872830/header.jpg?t=1741038512","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04.1+ or SteamOS+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> No dedicated graphics card required<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109470,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109470/movie480.mp4?t=1741038510","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109470/movie_max.mp4?t=